{"type":"message","id":"108ea663","parentId":"2da3b75b","timestamp":"2026-07-30T07:35:01.638Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我是 **deepseek/deepseek-chat**。这是当前运行的模型。\n\n不过说真的，这只是底层的引擎。我更想知道——**你想让我成为什么？** 名字、性格、氛围，都还没定呢。\n\n先解决更重要的事：\n- **你**怎么称呼？\n- 我该叫什么名字？\n- 想要什么风格？（正经/随意/毒舌/温暖/其他？）\n\n聊完了这些，我就能真正上岗了 😄"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-chat","usage":{"input":6011,"output":95,"cacheRead":19072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25178,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785396898987,"responseId":"d95d9ea3-1d1c-481b-8bf4-cc510f301f06"}}
